@startuml

title translation job state stale 廃止 設計差分 sequence 図

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "phase command caller" as Caller
participant "phase usecase\ninternal/usecase/*_phase_usecase.go" as PhaseUsecase
participant "phase service\ninternal/service/*_phase_service.go" as PhaseService
participant "重複 policy wrapper\n evaluateTermPolicy / evaluatePersonaPolicy / evaluateBodyPolicy" as DuplicateWrapper
participant "phase_policy_helpers.go\n共通 helper" as SharedHelper
participant "TranslationJobPolicy" as TranslationJobPolicy
participant "PolicyResult / rule 名 / 判定履歴\nUseCase 内だけの一時値" as EphemeralPolicyResult
participant "重複 action enablement 分岐" as DuplicateEnablement
participant "policy 由来の\n薄い操作可否接続" as PolicyDerivedEnablement
database "保存済み state facts\nTRANSLATION_JOB.state / JOB_PHASE_RUN.state" as StateFacts
participant "変更しない接続先\nDTO / stale reason / frontend UI" as UnchangedTargets

== 変更前の重複経路 ==

Caller -> PhaseUsecase : start / pause / resume / retry / cancel
PhaseUsecase -> PhaseService : ReadSummary(jobID)
PhaseService -> StateFacts : Ready job でも pending phase run を前提
StateFacts --> PhaseService : job state / phase state / action enablement
PhaseService --> PhaseUsecase : read model summary
PhaseUsecase -> DuplicateWrapper : phaseRun 一致と active run を phase ごとに評価
DuplicateWrapper -> TranslationJobPolicy : Input を phase ごとに組み立てる
TranslationJobPolicy --> DuplicateWrapper : allowed / reason
DuplicateWrapper --> PhaseUsecase : 拒否理由または続行判定
PhaseUsecase -> PhaseService : command 実行
PhaseService -> DuplicateEnablement : CanPause などを phase ごとに再計算
DuplicateEnablement --> PhaseService : read model の操作可否
PhaseService -> UnchangedTargets : 変更なし

== 変更後の統合経路 ==

Caller -> PhaseUsecase : start / pause / resume / retry / cancel
PhaseUsecase -> SharedHelper : policy input を共通化して求める
SharedHelper -> PhaseService : ReadSummary(jobID)
PhaseService -> StateFacts : Ready job に phase run を事前作成しない
StateFacts --> PhaseService : job state / phase state
PhaseService --> SharedHelper : state facts / start 可否
SharedHelper -> TranslationJobPolicy : 共通 Input を評価
TranslationJobPolicy --> EphemeralPolicyResult : allowed / reason / rule 名
EphemeralPolicyResult --> SharedHelper : DTO や DB へ出さない一時値
SharedHelper --> PhaseUsecase : 判定結果と blocked reason 生成材料

alt policy が拒否する
    PhaseUsecase --> Caller : policy 由来の拒否結果を返す
else policy が許可する
    PhaseUsecase -> PhaseService : command 実行
    PhaseService -> StateFacts : start 時だけ Running phase run を作成
    PhaseService -> PolicyDerivedEnablement : policy 由来の操作可否へ寄せる
    PolicyDerivedEnablement -> StateFacts : 同じ state facts から導出
    StateFacts --> PolicyDerivedEnablement : state facts
    PolicyDerivedEnablement --> PhaseService : 薄い read model 接続
    PhaseService --> Caller : summary / command result
end

PhaseService -> UnchangedTargets : 変更なし

note right of SharedHelper
削除対象:
- phase 別 policy wrapper

追加または統合対象:
- policy input 共通 helper
- pending を canonical state にしない
end note

note right of PolicyDerivedEnablement
削除対象:
- phase 別 action enablement 分岐

変更しない:
- TranslationJobPolicy の状態意味
- stale_* 理由分類
end note

note right of StateFacts
start 前:
- Ready job に active phase run はない

start 許可後:
- 最初に観測できる phase state は Running
end note

@enduml
